  {
    "episode_id": 49330,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/9/49330.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 9,
    "turn_text": "this. I know you're a great advocate for self-employed individuals like songwriters and composers who basically are gig workers. I mean, these are gig related works that these are specific. of the specific projects. So thank you for taking up the cause on behalf of all of us, but specifically those members. Can you tell us a little bit about what's been done so far as far as COVID relief on the Hill?",
