    "turn_text": "You know, one of the things that just in the body of your answer to that question, you answered a question that I was going to ask a little later on, which I think is really important. People really want to know, is it going to make a difference when they reach out to their congressmen, if they're writing emails or sending letters or making phone calls? And based on what you just said, it's incredibly important for our members to become really active in their advocacy.",
