    "turn_text": "It's the most amazing feeling to walk the halls and to know that you can really make a difference, walk into somebody's office and have a one-on-one conversation. Do you think most of your colleagues really understand that the way our world has collapsed in the sense that it has, that this could go on for months and months for music readers, that we're going to need relief that is not just a quick band aid, but we're going to need help possibly for a long time to come. Certainly, it's going to be probably well into 2021.",
