    "turn_text": "you know, he would have to move here and become a citizen. I'll tell you who I think is a great example. Is Bono. I met with him a number of times to talk about the work that he does fighting HIV AIDS and malaria, the enormous philanthropic work that he has done. And what I have been so impressed about by, you know, among many other things is his in-depth knowledge of these issues. You know, he'll come to advocate for funding, I said, on the State and Foreign Operations Committee, funding for international efforts to fight disease. And he often knows the subject matter better than most members of Congress. And so, you know, I would love to have him apply for US citizenship and run for Congress, but only if you're not willing, Paul.",
